Package: tinyshinyserver
Type: Package
Title: Tiny 'shiny' Server - Lightweight Multi-App 'shiny' Proxy
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Lars", family = "Bernhardsson", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "cran.sherry228@passinbox.com")
    )
Description: A lightweight proxy server that hosts multiple 'shiny'
    applications, including interactive 'R Markdown' documents and 'Quarto'
    dashboards, each in its own R process. It forwards HTTP and 'WebSocket'
    traffic, keeps apps running or starts them on demand, restarts failed
    apps, and provides a web dashboard for monitoring and management. The
    server is configured with a JSON file.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
